  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.05 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Chiropractic Examiners",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.05 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for the Profession Regulated by the Board of Chiropractic Examiners. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for chiropractors as regulated by the board of chiropractic examiners under RSA 316-A shall be $69.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.04)",
